Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:17:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 09/14] Input: add Samsung FTS1BA90 touch and Wacom W9019 pen
 drivers

Drivers for the SM-T545 touch controller (FTS1BA90, protocol taken from the Samsung driver) and the Wacom W9019 pen digitizer.
---
 drivers/input/touchscreen/Kconfig            |  12 +
 drivers/input/touchscreen/Makefile           |   2 +
 drivers/input/touchscreen/fts1ba90-t545.c    | 233 +++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/input/touchscreen/wacom-w9019-t545.c | 173 ++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 420 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/input/touchscreen/fts1ba90-t545.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/input/touchscreen/wacom-w9019-t545.c

